# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). Every key is optional: the database is not
# here (the Worker reaches it through the HYPERDRIVE binding, wrangler.jsonc).
#
# The session key. Unset, it is the one the database generated for itself
# (migration 020_app_secrets, lib/auth/secret.ts).
# AUTH_SECRET=change-me-openssl-rand-base64-32
#
# Stripe. Unset, the pricing page says checkout is not connected and the
# webhook answers 503. In stage/prod these are Worker secrets the owner sets
# once per environment: `wrangler secret put <NAME> --name saas-starter-web-<env>`
# (README, "Connect Stripe").
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_***
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_***
#
# Where Stripe sends the browser back to; wrangler.jsonc's var is the deployed
# value, this one overrides it locally.
BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
